 "A simulation is born, grows, surprises its makers, and eventually stops.": "1939aa4d1664.mp3",
 "Phases walks through each stage of that life — what happens, what matters, and what can go wrong.": "fee3c6c21495.mp3",
 "Phase 1: Conception.": "003a5a6d3664.mp3",
 "Before a single line runs, someone asks a question: what if?": "b1cbdf6d8ef3.mp3",
 "This phase defines the purpose of the simulation, the rules of its world, and which parts of reality are worth modeling — and which can be left out.": "a3537eee1948.mp3",
 "Phase 2: Initialization.": "00bfa5c8c4ab.mp3",
 "The world is seeded.": "8fc34ac94bdb.mp3",
