 "Phase 3: Execution.": "150c48f81583.mp3",
 "Time begins to move.": "26a68083dc50.mp3",
 "Tick by tick, the rules are applied and the world evolves.": "ea2670a08cca.mp3",
 "This is the longest phase — the simulation's working life.": "3d5ca303829a.mp3",
 "Phase 4: Emergence.": "250a8836237a.mp3",
