 "Phase 6: Termination.": "2feab1a9c781.mp3",
 "Every simulation ends — by reaching its goal, running out of time, or collapsing.": "801440c77f83.mp3",
 "Its state is saved, its lessons are written down, and its ending often becomes the seed of the next one.": "300863115a3b.mp3",
